	(text "SA0 low gives 0x6A; SDx, SCx grounded (no slave sensors); CS high selects I2C.\nPins 10, 11 are soldered but must stay unconnected.\nINT1, INT2 are push-pull, active high: INT1 can wake the module (pick-up, tap, tilt).\nC33 on VDD, C34 on VDDIO, each beside its pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 106.68 0)
