	(text "Pads 3-8 and 12-15 are NC and left open. No interrupt pin on this part.\nC40 (4.7 uF, low ESR, 0603) on C1 is mandatory. C39 decouples VDD.\nNo copper under or near it on either face; keep steel and magnets away.\nDraws 22 uA even when suspended. Needs a figure-of-eight calibration."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 101.6 0)
