	(text "3V3 - R35 || R37 - buzzer - Q4 - ground; D24 across the buzzer takes the coil kick.\nPassive buzzer, about 12 ohms: drive IO4 with a 4 kHz square wave.\nR36 (4.7k) holds Q4 off against the 45k pull-up CircuitPython puts on unclaimed pins.\nR35 || R37 (50 ohms) limit the current to 53 mA if the pin is ever left high:\n71 mW in each. Take one off for a quieter buzzer; do not fit less than 100R each."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c9052f9d-d2c6-5db8-ae39-1c04de05d0eb")
	)
)
